<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 74.4900 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 74.4900 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.4900 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 74.7000 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Mar 31		  Mar 28</p>
<p> High			     74.6000		 74.9900</p>
<p> Low				74.2500		 74.6000</p>
<p> Open			     74.6000		 74.9900</p>
<p> Close			    74.4900		 74.7000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     2.755		   7.090</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
